Today is an important day.
Our new project officially starts at the office today.
Right now, I am on the bus to Infopark.
Outside, it is raining continuously.
It is the monsoon season in Kochi.
I always go to the office on this bus.
I have travelled on this bus many times.
The bus conductor asks for the ticket money.
"Give me twenty rupees," he says.
I give twenty rupees and buy the ticket.
When I think about the new project, I have a little fear and a lot of excitement.
I have prepared some notes for today's meeting.
I wrote it during the last weekend.
I open my bag and take the book out.
I am reading those notes now.
I have clearly written the things to do in it.
The bus is moving forward slowly through the rain.
After a little while, we will reach Infopark.
I hope today's meeting goes well.
